Agentic AI System Design
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mv7eiQFQQ1E

Scope & Assumptions
	Scope - 
      Who is the user and what problem are they having ?
      What outcome are we trying to improve ?
      Which part of this problem should AI handle ?
      How much agency should the system have ?
	Assumptions - Data, types of input, Operating Constraints, Risk of actions
Architecture
	KARC - Know, Act, Remember, Co-ordinate
	Know -> 
	Act -> Permissions, Blast Radius, Failure handling (Fallback policies), Trust Boundaries
	Remember -> Memory - Working, Semantic, Episodic, Procedural
	Co-ordinate -> 
Observability
	Log, Eval, Improve
Production & Ops
	Scale, Latency, Reliability, Freshness or latest, Security
Optimization
	Latency, Cost, Quality, Specific failure patterns
